{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_02603","headline":"奉和幸江都应诏 · 虞世南","name":"奉和幸江都应诏","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"南国行周化，稽山秘夏图。\n百王岂殊轨，千载协前谟。\n肆觐遵时豫，顺动悦来苏。\n安流进玉轴，戒道翼金吾。\n龙旗焕辰象，凤吹溢川涂。\n封唐昔敷锡，分陕被荆吴。\n沐道咸知让，慕义久成都。\n冬律初飞管，阳鸟正衔芦。\n严飙肃林薄，暧景澹江湖。\n鸿私浃幽远，厚泽润凋枯。\n虞琴起歌咏，汉筑动巴歈。\n多幸沾行苇，无庸类散樗。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"虞世南","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_02603.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_02603","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}